{
  "description": "Golden parity for recruitmentAnalytics.getKpis: the PURE buildKpiView(input) in @tims/shared. Asserted IDENTICALLY by the REAL TS export (tests/reporting/kpi-view-fixtures.test.ts) and the C# Tims.Domain.Reporting.KpiViewBuilder (Tims.UnitTests, camelCase). Pins: ttf/tth average only non-negative spans over offers with the needed timestamps; respondedAt-null excluded from ttf/tth but counted in hires; offerAcceptRate + avgDays use JS half-up rounding (37.5->38, 30.5->31); lostByDelay counts rejections STRICTLY over SLA (== not counted), skipping null sla / null rejectedAt. Timestamps are epoch-ms (day = 86400000).",
